cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "scilib: an MCP server for open-access scientific literature"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
authors:
  - alias: Hiran001
repository-code: "https://github.com/Hiran001/scilib-mcp"
abstract: >-
  An MCP server that gives an AI assistant federated search across the open
  scholarly record, full-text retrieval through legal open-access routes with
  per-file provenance, and full-text search over a researcher's existing local
  library. Uses only documented public APIs.
keywords:
  - model context protocol
  - open access
  - open science
  - literature search
  - research software
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
